# Append-only engineering logs merge with the exawatt-append driver (BUG-203):
# two pure insertions at the same anchor keep both, ours first, unless they
# introduce the same id; anything else stays an ordinary conflict. The driver
# is installed by `pnpm hooks:install`; without it git merges these as text.
docs/engineering/roadmap.md merge=exawatt-append
docs/engineering/projects/*.md merge=exawatt-append
docs/engineering/incidents/README.md merge=exawatt-append
